& [Need]
  + A6 leaves ordinal seven unresolved; exact public metadata lineage helps audit and a later confidential seam
& [Choice]
  + pure correspondence preserves secret_reference_only and exposes no resolver while complete A6 replay prevents adverse-state loss
& [RejectedAlternatives]
  + reading a permit lacks confidential source authority; treating hash byte count or reference as authentication creates a confused deputy; skipping to A8 violates dependency
& [Boundary]
  + only bounded provider-free implementation may follow published formation; permit use and downstream effects remain unauthorized
